			Search-box size vector `[width, height]` in |term|`Image_units`.
		pattern:
			Pattern-box size vector `[width, height]` in |term|`Image_units`.
		offset:
			Offset vector in |term|`Image_units` from the lower-left pattern corner to the point position.
		rot:
			Pattern rotation angle in radians; mathematically positive direction (counterclockwise).
	Returns:
		|None|
	Raises:
		TypeError:
			|Must| raise if the given arguments do not match the required types/signature.
		ValueError:
			|Must| raise if |var|`pgroup_id` does not refer to an existing point group.
			|Must| raise if |var|`point_id` does not refer to an existing point in the given point group.
			|Must| raise if |var|`camera_id` does not refer to an existing camera.
			|Must| raise if |var|`frame` is outside the valid frame range of the given camera.
